description.p:
Vibe coding gets an agent built in minutes. Day 2 is where the real work starts. Google Cloud's 2026 roadshow returns with ADK, RAG, Gemma 4, and Antigravity 2.0, across eight North American cities.

{ author: @shirmeir86 + @GoogleAI }

https://t.co/xXbVQJZvCT

Long conversations drift, and the AI never announces that it dropped a constraint ten messages back. This dev adds one chosen word to the top of every reply as a cue, and draws the parallel to canary tokens.

{ author: @Thomasbnt_ }

https://t.co/nD43tVpwxY

A caching bug that eluded this dev for a full evening of staring at the screen suddenly became apparent while turning compost. This dev makes the case that observation and patience carry over from the garden.

